      <activity id="5deed554-7618-5d61-905c-027e00e510e1" activityNameId="8e4f2d23-0c13-59e8-87db-cfa04eb003bf" activityNameContextId="f44c43c1-5cc5-54a6-ade6-24435bd12c83" type="1" specialActivityType="0" energyValues="0">
        <activityName xml:lang="en">Transport, natural gas, offshore pipeline, long distance</activityName>
        <generalComment>
          <text xml:lang="en" index="1">Full activity name: Transport, natural gas, offshore pipeline, long distance
Infrastructure requirements are based on estimated standard capacity. UUID=5c1932f3-5b9e-3a0e-b7b6-1409bb16f3cd
This dataset describes the energy consumption and the emissions linked to the transport of American natural gas in an offshore pipeline.
Location: The data for emissions are based on European data and for energy requirements on German data.
Technology: Long-distance transport offshore with  average compressor station.
Time period: The data for emissions is from 2006, the data for energy requirements from 2001
Production volume: not known
Sampling: Literature.
Extrapolations: none
Uncertainty adjustments: none
BAFU mapped export: unsupported biosphere exchanges excluded; see audit/. Local UUIDs and generic activity classification are export conventions. Source: process_5c1932f3-5b9e-3a0e-b7b6-1409bb16f3cd.xml</text>
        </generalComment>
      </activity>
      <geography geographyId="9aaa4753-f7ef-5e0d-bcb0-bc5f01164c5b" geographyContextId="f44c43c1-5cc5-54a6-ade6-24435bd12c83">
